      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sociologically, rapid demographic shifts like this often lead to what is termed \"cultural enrichment\" in some analyses, as diverse traditions introduce new businesses and community life. Conversely, some residents may experience cultural dissonance or perceive a decline in the established \"neighborhood character,\" leading to social friction. The impact on \"social harmony\" often depends on the existing levels of economic integration and the presence of community-building initiatives across different groups. Overall outcomes tend to be complex, oscillating between increased vibrancy and perceived social strain depending on policy and community engagement.",
